WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.759 align:start position:19%
In the Nevada desert sits something that
looks like another planet. Fly geyser. A

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:13.360 align:start position:19%
tower of rainbow colored rocks spraying
hot water into the sky. But this is not

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:18.000 align:start position:19%
natural. In 1964, an energy company
drilled a test well here. The water was

00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:22.800 align:start position:19%
not hot enough for power, so they left.
The cap failed. For 60 years, scalding

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:28.320 align:start position:19%
mineral water has erupted, building this
mound inch by inch. Heatloving algae

00:00:25.519 --> 00:00:31.760 align:start position:19%
painted red and green. A human mistake
turned into a wonder.

